      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Note: IKPoses used here is a animation like https://xiphia.booth.pm/items/2783859 . As I know.\nPurpose of these IKPoses are modifing knee bend direction for 6 point FBT.\nIK2.0 may have tweak for elbow and knee bend direction.\nSo, I think IKPose's knee direction modification is ignored or less effective in IK2.0.\nI think it would be better to add a setting for the direction of elbow and knee bending(inside or outside).",
